{"id":"956417a47f","t":"The Eldest Daughter’s Flower path","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/The-Eldest-Daughter-193x278.jpg","n":50,"l":50,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path","az":"the-eldest-daughter's-flower-path"},"u":1795077208599,"desc":"وُلدت راديس الابنة الكبرى لعائلة تيلرود، ولم تكن ذات مكانة رفيعة ولا محبوبة. كان من المفترض أن تكون قربانًا دائمًا. لكن بعد أن تحملت الكثير حتى أُنهك جسدها، لم تجنِ في النهاية إلا الخيانة. وُلد الابن البكر. كان الأب يتوق إلى ابنه؛ لكن كل ذلك كان مجرد حلم. ما كان عليّ أن أعيش من أجل أبي، أو إخوتي، أو رئيسي، أو عشيرتي… كان عليّ أن أعيش… من أجل نفسي! في اللحظة الأخيرة التي ظننتها النهاية، عادت راديس إلى عامها السادس عشر.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى"],"src":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path","az":"the-eldest-daughter's-flower-path"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/1/","az":"the-eldest-daughter's-flower-path|/series/the-eldest-daughter's-flower-path/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daughters-flower-path/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-eldest-daughters-flower-path|/manga/the-eldest-daugh